    <div id="infoPanel">
      <div class="panelHeader">
        <img src="/static/info-circle.svg" alt="Information" />
      </div>
      <div class="panelContent">
        <div>
          <h2>Note:</h2>
          <p>
            The new ICAO-PKD supported features are Bar Code Signer certificate
            (BCSC), and Bar Code Signer for non-constrained environments
            certificate (BCSC-NC).
          </p>
          <p>For more information, please check below:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>
              ICAO Doc9303 Edition 8:
              <a
                href="https://www.icao.int/publications/Documents/9303_p13_cons_en.pdf"
                >ICAO Doc9303 Edition 8 Part 13</a
              >
            </li>
            <li>
              Visible Digital Seals for Non-Electronic Documents:
              <a
                href="https://www.icao.int/Security/FAL/TRIP/Documents/Technical%20Report%20-%20Visible%20Digital%20Seal-NC%20V1.4.pdf"
                >ICAO TECHNICAL REPORT, VDS-NC, Visible Digital Seal for
                non-constrained environments, Version – 1.4</a
              >
              Digital Seals
            </li>
          </ul>
          <p>
            In addition, the LDIF collection 001 files contain the following:
          </p>
          <ul>
            <li>o=bcsc : organization entry for BCSC certificate</li>
            <li>o=bcsc-nc : organization entry for BCSC-NC certificate</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

